    <h1>The Frontline Connector: <em>Connector</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If people open up to you, and you are the one who gets two sides to actually trust each other, Connector is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, why it is about trust rather than being outgoing, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that comes with it.</p>
