      <li>Kim Scott, <a href="https://www.radicalcandor.com/our-approach/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Radical Candor: the two axes and Ruinous Empathy</a> (caring personally but failing to challenge directly).</li>
      <li>Quantum Workplace and Fierce Conversations, <a href="https://learn.workbravely.com/hubfs/Understanding-the-Conversation-Gap.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Understanding the Conversation Gap</a>, 2017 (70% avoid a difficult conversation).</li>
      <li>U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, <a href="https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/medical-and-health-services-managers.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Medical and Health Services Managers</a>, 2025 (23% growth; $117,960 median).</li>
      <li>U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, <a href="https://www.bls.gov/ooh/management/human-resources-managers.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Human Resources Managers</a>, 2024 (the link between management and employees; $140,030 median).</li>
      <li>World Economic Forum, <a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/in-full/3-skills-outlook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Future of Jobs Report 2025, Skills Outlook</a> (empathy and active listening among top core skills).</li>
    </ul>
